/ A form page re-rendered after a failed POST has no GET route, so switch to the home page instead.
div class="flex rounded-full bg-slate-100 p-0.5 text-xs font-bold" aria-label=t(".label")
  - I18n.available_locales.each do |locale|
    - url_locale = locale == I18n.default_locale ? nil : locale
    - href = request.get? ? url_for(request.query_parameters.merge(locale: url_locale)) : root_path(locale: url_locale)
    = link_to locale.to_s.upcase, href,
        hreflang: locale, lang: locale, aria: { current: ("true" if locale == I18n.locale) },
        class: [ "rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 transition", locale == I18n.locale ? "bg-white text-emerald-700 shadow-sm" : "text-slate-500 hover:text-ink" ]
